    261  f11a							; Check collisions
    262  f11a							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    263  f11a							; Tests the proposed 8x8 player footprint against the room tile map.
    264  f11a							; Horizontal: room pixel -> tile column via >>3 (8 pixel columns).
    265  f11a							; Vertical:   kernel row -> tile row via (96 - kernelRow) >> 2, because the
    266  f11a							; kernel renders map row 0 at the top (high kernel row) and the map occupies
    267  f11a							; 64 kernel rows (16 tile rows). Returns C=0 if clear, C=1 if blocked.
